          "lines": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "{name}의 연습 화면이 꺼지지 않은 채 새벽까지 켜져 있다."
            }
          ],
          "i18n": {
            "En": {
              "lines": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "{name}'s practice screen is still on at dawn."
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "next": "4c2aefa5-9c5a-5d33-92ba-42e5df946331"
        },
        "4c2aefa5-9c5a-5d33-92ba-42e5df946331": {
          "localId": 3,
          "type": "Dialog",
          "speaker": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
          "lines": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "또 막혔어요. 지난번엔 넘었는데, 이번엔 더 높은 것 같아요."
            }
          ],
          "i18n": {
            "En": {
              "lines": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "I'm stuck again. I got past it last time, but this wall feels higher."
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "next": "bbb98f14-7c67-5e21-9b1b-c6c0fb3c61e8"
        },
        "bbb98f14-7c67-5e21-9b1b-c6c0fb3c61e8": {
          "localId": 4,
          "type": "Dialog",
          "speaker": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
          "lines": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "연습량은 그대로인데 손이 안 따라와요."
            }
          ],
          "i18n": {
            "En": {
              "lines": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "I practice as much as ever, but my hands won't follow."
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "next": "84466fd4-bcda-5d1e-b8d3-6c4b181d9cff"
        },
        "84466fd4-bcda-5d1e-b8d3-6c4b181d9cff": {
          "localId": 5,
          "type": "Dialog",
          "speaker": "23f70dcf-de2b-50ea-a210-97bcdd22d3a0",
          "lines": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "벽이 높아졌다는 건 그만큼 올라왔다는 뜻이야. 이번에도 실전에서 깨 보자."
            }
          ],
          "i18n": {
            "En": {
              "lines": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "A higher wall means you've climbed that far. Let's break it in real matches again."
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "next": "3528ce34-56ce-5b0a-9dce-edec4d2b852b"
        },
        "3528ce34-56ce-5b0a-9dce-edec4d2b852b": {
          "localId": 6,
          "type": "Select",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "698c201f-0ab7-5226-a8b2-c60de71159a0",
              "text": "(목표 고르기 — 게임이 목표 셋으로 바꾼다)",
              "next": "3dc2c8cb-3790-512a-99da-802a1629aab6",
              "i18n": {
                "En": {
                  "text": "(Goal pick — the game replaces it with three goals)"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "3dc2c8cb-3790-512a-99da-802a1629aab6": {
          "localId": 7,
          "type": "Dialog",
          "speaker": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
          "lines": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "좋아요. 목표가 생기니 좀 보이는 것 같아요."
            }
          ],
          "i18n": {
            "En": {
              "lines": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "Okay. With a goal, I think I can see the way."
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "next": "666ea78a-31f0-58b7-a80a-1edbef3eb39d"
        },
        "666ea78a-31f0-58b7-a80a-1edbef3eb39d": {
          "localId": 8,
          "type": "Dialog",
          "speaker": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
          "lines": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "이번에도 넘어 보일게요."
            }
          ],
          "i18n": {
            "En": {
              "lines": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": "I'll get past this one too."
                }
              ]
            }
          },
